<title>JAPAN: Daiwa, Yasuda to make announcements on bad loans.</title>
<headline>Daiwa, Yasuda to make announcements on bad loans.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-09-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Daiwa Bank Ltd and Yasuda Trust &amp; Banking Co Ltd said that they would make separate announcements on Monday on their bad loans to &quot;jusen&quot; housing-loan companies.</p>
<p>Daiwa will make its announcement at 3 p.m. (0600 GMT) and Yasuda at 4 p.m. (0700 GMT).</p>
</text>
